<title>SWITZERLAND: Ascom sells Italian tool-making unit.</title>
<headline>Ascom sells Italian tool-making unit.</headline>
<dateline>BERNE 1996-12-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Ascom Holding Ltd said it sold its Italian subsidiary S.I.S.C.A.T. Spa in mid-December to an Italian group of buyers.</p>
<p>S.I.S.C.A.T., headquartered in Martinengo, is a tool-making company specialising in mould production and thermoplastics moulding.</p>
<p>The company employs 100 people and reported revenues last year of 12 million Swiss francs, Ascom said. It said the sale represented a continuation of its strategy to concentrate on core activities.</p>
<p>-- Zurich Editorial +41 1 631 7340</p>
</text>
